    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1586">

                <pb facs="1281" n="1165" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1165"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.001 P 82.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President to the President of Panama</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The White House</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-10-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 1, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In extending to Your Excellency on the occasion of your inauguration the
                    felicitations of the Government of the United States, I express my own
                    sentiments and those of my fellow citizens in wishing, for the Republic,
                    continued prosperity and happiness under your administration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. H. Taft.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
